{"id":"9752b779c5f463f9","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-geometric-morphism.md","title":"Definition — Geometric Morphism","display":"Definition — Geometric Morphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-geometric-morphism","aliases":["14-df-geometric-morphism"],"display":"Definition — Geometric Morphism","depends_on":["[[14-df-small-category]]","[[14-df-category]]","[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]","[[14-df-limits-colimits]]","[[14-df-functor]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-geometric-morphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-geometric-morphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — Geometric Morphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"898681611f432286\" href=\"?note=898681611f432286\" title=\"14-df-small-category\">14-df-small-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d2b4e5cf16585f95\" href=\"?note=d2b4e5cf16585f95\" title=\"14-df-adjoint-functors\">14-df-adjoint-functors</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"55bd5d1a324171ab\" href=\"?note=55bd5d1a324171ab\" title=\"14-df-limits-colimits\">14-df-limits-colimits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1f1269584b34ad4b\" href=\"?note=1f1269584b34ad4b\" title=\"14-df-functor\">14-df-functor</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}(\\mathcal E),\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}(\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}(\\mathcal E),\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}(\\mathcal F)\\)</span> (topoi, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f=(f^*,f_*)\">\\(f=(f^*,f_*)\\)</span> (inverse- and direct-image functors)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}\\)</span> (adjunction predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d2b4e5cf16585f95\" href=\"?note=d2b4e5cf16585f95\" title=\"14-df-adjoint-functors\">14-df-adjoint-functors</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsFunctor}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsFunctor}\\)</span> (functor predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1f1269584b34ad4b\" href=\"?note=1f1269584b34ad4b\" title=\"14-df-functor\">14-df-functor</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsLimit}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsLimit}\\)</span> (limit-cone predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"55bd5d1a324171ab\" href=\"?note=55bd5d1a324171ab\" title=\"14-df-limits-colimits\">14-df-limits-colimits</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsCategory},\\mathrm{Ob},\\mathrm{Mor}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsCategory},\\mathrm{Ob},\\mathrm{Mor}\\)</span> (category operations, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsGeometricMorphism}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsGeometricMorphism}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsGeometricMorphism}(f,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}(\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(f^*,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(f_*,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(f^*,f_*)\\land\\forall K,D,L,\\pi\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{IsSmallCategory}(K)\\land|\\mathrm{Ob}(K)|\\in\\mathbb N\\land|\\mathrm{Mor}(K)|\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(D,K,\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{IsLimit}_{\\mathcal E}(L,\\pi,D)\\to\\mathrm{IsLimit}_{\\mathcal F}(f^*(L),(f^*(\\pi_k))_{k\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(K)},f^*\\circ D)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsGeometricMorphism}(f,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}(\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(f^*,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(f_*,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(f^*,f_*)\\land\\forall K,D,L,\\pi\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{IsSmallCategory}(K)\\land|\\mathrm{Ob}(K)|\\in\\mathbb N\\land|\\mathrm{Mor}(K)|\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(D,K,\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{IsLimit}_{\\mathcal E}(L,\\pi,D)\\to\\mathrm{IsLimit}_{\\mathcal F}(f^*(L),(f^*(\\pi_k))_{k\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(K)},f^*\\circ D)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：VII.1 Geometric Morphisms and Basic Examples，印刷页 348–352。</p>\n<p>几何态射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E\">\\(f:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E\\)</span> 的逆像方向为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^*:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal F\">\\(f^*:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal F\\)</span>，它是保有限极限的左伴随；直像为其右伴随。签名中的源/靶与这一方向一致。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-small-category","status":"resolved","id":"898681611f432286","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-small-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"d2b4e5cf16585f95","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-limits-colimits","status":"resolved","id":"55bd5d1a324171ab","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-limits-colimits]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"1f1269584b34ad4b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}(\\mathcal E),\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}(\\mathcal F)$ (topoi, see [[14-df-elementary-topos]])","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"d2b4e5cf16585f95","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}$ (adjunction predicate, see [[14-df-adjoint-functors]])","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-functor","status":"resolved","i