ations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-geometric-morphism|Definition — Geometric Morphism]]"},{"id":"06765da425264baa","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-geometric-morphism]] 的几何态射；所有全忠实、保守条件均相对于这两个已绑定的范畴。"},{"id":"4875436f4c986c7f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-geometric-morphism]] 的几何态射；所有全忠实、保守条件均相对于这两个已绑定的范畴。"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-43","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-geometric-morphism]]"},{"id":"98e8376f342f77c0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-geometric-morphism]] 的几何态射；所有全忠实、保守条件均相对于这两个已绑定的范畴。"},{"id":"0a94cb99ec341b7c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-geometric-morphism]] 的几何态射；所有全忠实、保守条件均相对于这两个已绑定的范畴。"},{"id":"9fefe9c472fa2311","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal F,\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯；几何态射采用 [[14-df-geometric-morphism]]，自然变换采用 [[14-df-natural-transformation]]。"},{"id":"173e95f9b43447c0","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ 是 [[14-df-geometric-morphism]] 的几何态射，$L:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ 为候选函子。$\\operatorname{IsAdjunctionData}(L,f^*,\\eta,\\varepsilon)$ 采用 [[14-df-adjoint-functors]]，拉回谓词采用 [[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]；同构谓词的环境下标采用 [[14-df-isomorphism]]。"},{"id":"afcd93ebfca63623","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-geometric-morphism]] 的几何态射；所有全忠实、保守条件均相对于这两个已绑定的范畴。"},{"id":"86c3a123f8ca1262","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"逆像部分另设 $f:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-geometric-morphism]] 的几何态射；$\\mathcal F$ 的积也按同一递归方式选取。$c_{\\vec s}$ 是下式的有限积比较，空序列时为到所选终对象的唯一箭头。对每个 $r\\in R$，$m_r:R_r\\hookrightarrow\\Pi_{M_0}(\\operatorname{ar}(r))$ 为 $M_r$ 的任一代表。"},{"id":"db72d6d752e21e20","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-geometric-morphism]] 的几何态射；所有全忠实、保守条件均相对于这两个已绑定的范畴。"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-43","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-geometric-morphism]]"},{"id":"9f240b2829f1b115","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-geometric-morphism]] 的几何态射；所有全忠实、保守条件均相对于这两个已绑定的范畴。"},{"id":"3cced0e71a2282b9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-224","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-geometric-morphism|Definition — Geometric Morphism]]"},{"id":"a987285ba9cb0966","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$、$g:\\mathcal G\\to\\mathcal F$ 为 [[14-df-geometric-morphism]] 的几何态射。"},{"id":"a0c4bf7fbcc14304","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-geometric-morphism]] 的几何态射；所有全忠实、保守条件均相对于这两个已绑定的范畴。"},{"id":"8dd39e9fd83ff83f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-geometric-morphism]] 的几何态射；所有全忠实、保守条件均相对于这两个已绑定的范畴。"},{"id":"8e2ae868c0cc48ee","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"260987f5c0df74b8","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-geometric-morphism]] 的几何态射；所有全忠实、保守条件均相对于这两个已绑定的范畴。"},{"id":"f2895e14ad640cde","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-geometric-morphism]] 的几何态射；所有全忠实